{
  "story_id": "owl-in-the-oak",
  "chapter": 3,
  "total_duration_ms": 442200,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "On the second-to-last night of Mira's stay, Mira asked Opa a question.",
      "start_ms": 1549,
      "end_ms": 5779
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "She had been thinking about it for a while.",
      "start_ms": 5779,
      "end_ms": 8401
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "She said, \"Opa.",
      "start_ms": 8401,
      "end_ms": 9354
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "What happens when you can't come here anymore.",
      "start_ms": 9354,
      "end_ms": 12155
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "What happens to the owl.",
      "start_ms": 12155,
      "end_ms": 13644
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Does someone else come and see her.\" Opa put down his book.",
      "start_ms": 13644,
      "end_ms": 17219
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "He was quiet for a long moment.",
      "start_ms": 17219,
      "end_ms": 19126
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Then he said, \"I have thought about this a lot, Mira.",
      "start_ms": 19126,
      "end_ms": 22343
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "My father worried about this too.",
      "start_ms": 22343,
      "end_ms": 24369
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "He came here his whole life, and he told me, when he was very old, that he was sad that when he died there would be no one visiting the oak.",
      "start_ms": 24369,
      "end_ms": 32770
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "My father worried that the owl would be — I don't know.",
      "start_ms": 32770,
      "end_ms": 36107
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Alone.",
      "start_ms": 36107,
      "end_ms": 36524
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Not that she would be lonely, exactly.",
      "start_ms": 36524,
      "end_ms": 38847
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Owls are not lonely.",
      "start_ms": 38847,
      "end_ms": 40099
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "But that the — the connection — would break.",
      "start_ms": 40099,
      "end_ms": 42780
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "That she would be a wild owl in a wild forest again, with nobody knowing she was there.\"",
      "start_ms": 42780,
      "end_ms": 48142
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "\"And what did you do,\" said Mira.",
      "start_ms": 48142,
      "end_ms": 50168
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "\"I promised him I would come.",
      "start_ms": 50168,
      "end_ms": 51955
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "And I did come.",
      "start_ms": 51955,
      "end_ms": 52909
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Every summer since I was six, I have come.",
      "start_ms": 52909,
      "end_ms": 55471
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "But now I am seventy-three.",
      "start_ms": 55471,
      "end_ms": 57139
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "I have maybe another five or ten years of walking to the oak.",
      "start_ms": 57139,
      "end_ms": 60833
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Then I will not be able to.",
      "start_ms": 60833,
      "end_ms": 62501
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Someone else needs to come.",
      "start_ms": 62501,
      "end_ms": 64170
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "That is what I have been thinking.",
      "start_ms": 64170,
      "end_ms": 66255
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "That is why I have been teaching you the calls, Mira.",
      "start_ms": 66255,
      "end_ms": 69473
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "If it is okay with you.",
      "start_ms": 69473,
      "end_ms": 70902
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "If you want to.",
      "start_ms": 70902,
      "end_ms": 71856
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "I would like you to be the next person who visits the owl.",
      "start_ms": 71856,
      "end_ms": 75371
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Not right now.",
      "start_ms": 75371,
      "end_ms": 76265
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "You are ten.",
      "start_ms": 76265,
      "end_ms": 77039
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "But — for years to come.",
      "start_ms": 77039,
      "end_ms": 78529
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Maybe — maybe your whole life.\"",
      "start_ms": 78529,
      "end_ms": 80376
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Mira sat by the fire.",
      "start_ms": 80376,
      "end_ms": 81965
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "She was not surprised.",
      "start_ms": 81965,
      "end_ms": 83626
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "She had, in a small way, expected this.",
      "start_ms": 83626,
      "end_ms": 86515
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "She said, \"Opa.",
      "start_ms": 86515,
      "end_ms": 87671
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "What if she dies.",
      "start_ms": 87671,
      "end_ms": 88971
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "What if she is really an old owl, and she is really at the end of her life.",
      "start_ms": 88971,
      "end_ms": 94461
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "And she dies.",
      "start_ms": 94461,
      "end_ms": 95472
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Do I stop coming.\" Opa smiled.",
      "start_ms": 95472,
      "end_ms": 97711
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "He said, \"No.",
      "start_ms": 97711,
      "end_ms": 98722
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "You keep coming.",
      "start_ms": 98722,
      "end_ms": 99950
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "If she dies, there will be another owl.",
      "start_ms": 99950,
      "end_ms": 102839
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Maybe her chick.",
      "start_ms": 102839,
      "end_ms": 104067
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Maybe a stranger.",
      "start_ms": 104067,
      "end_ms": 105367
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Owls take over good hollows.",
      "start_ms": 105367,
      "end_ms": 107462
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "There is always an owl in the oak.",
      "start_ms": 107462,
      "end_ms": 109990
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "There has been for hundreds of years.",
      "start_ms": 109990,
      "end_ms": 112734
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "My father showed me a note in his own father's diary that mentioned an owl in the same hollow in 1918.",
      "start_ms": 112734,
      "end_ms": 120174
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "It was not the same owl.",
      "start_ms": 120174,
      "end_ms": 121980
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "It was probably not even the same family.",
      "start_ms": 121980,
      "end_ms": 125013
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "But it was an owl.",
      "start_ms": 125013,
      "end_ms": 126385
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "If the one we know dies, another will come.",
      "start_ms": 126385,
      "end_ms": 129564
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "You will meet the new one.\"",
      "start_ms": 129564,
      "end_ms": 131658
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "\"So it is not really the owl,\" Mira said, slowly.",
      "start_ms": 131658,
      "end_ms": 135270
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "\"It is the — the visiting.\" \"Yes,\" said Opa.",
      "start_ms": 135270,
      "end_ms": 138520
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "\"That is exactly right.",
      "start_ms": 138520,
      "end_ms": 140253
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "The tradition is not the owl.",
      "start_ms": 140253,
      "end_ms": 142420
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "The tradition is that someone in the family walks to the oak in the summer, sits with whoever is there, and makes the small trilling sound.",
      "start_ms": 142420,
      "end_ms": 152532
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "That is the tradition.",
      "start_ms": 152532,
      "end_ms": 154193
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "My great-great-grandfather started it, we think, in the 1800s.",
      "start_ms": 154193,
      "end_ms": 158744
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "It has kept going.",
      "start_ms": 158744,
      "end_ms": 160116
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Small.",
      "start_ms": 160116,
      "end_ms": 160622
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Quiet.",
      "start_ms": 160622,
      "end_ms": 161127
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Only one person at a time.",
      "start_ms": 161127,
      "end_ms": 163077
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "But going.\"",
      "start_ms": 163077,
      "end_ms": 163872
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "\"Yes,\" said Mira.",
      "start_ms": 163872,
      "end_ms": 165089
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "\"I will do it.",
      "start_ms": 165089,
      "end_ms": 166103
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "For my whole life.\" Opa smiled.",
      "start_ms": 166103,
      "end_ms": 168266
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "He said, \"Good.",
      "start_ms": 168266,
      "end_ms": 169348
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Thank you, Mira.",
      "start_ms": 169348,
      "end_ms": 170497
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "That is a big promise.",
      "start_ms": 170497,
      "end_ms": 172052
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "I will hold you to it.\" Mira said, \"Do I need to teach someone.",
      "start_ms": 172052,
      "end_ms": 176379
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Later.",
      "start_ms": 176379,
      "end_ms": 176852
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "When I am old.\" \"Yes,\" said Opa.",
      "start_ms": 176852,
      "end_ms": 179083
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "\"You will.",
      "start_ms": 179083,
      "end_ms": 179827
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "You will find someone in the family — maybe your child, maybe your niece, maybe your grandchild — who is the right person.",
      "start_ms": 179827,
      "end_ms": 188143
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "You will know them when you see them.",
      "start_ms": 188143,
      "end_ms": 190712
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "It will feel obvious.",
      "start_ms": 190712,
      "end_ms": 192199
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Then you teach them the calls.",
      "start_ms": 192199,
      "end_ms": 194295
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Then, when you cannot walk to the oak anymore, they take over.\" Mira nodded seriously.",
      "start_ms": 194295,
      "end_ms": 200176
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "She said, \"How will I know.\" Opa said, \"You will know because they will be a child who notices small things.",
      "start_ms": 200176,
      "end_ms": 207546
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "The way you noticed the small blue moon lantern — no, wait, that was a different story I read once.",
      "start_ms": 207546,
      "end_ms": 214306
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "You will know because they will be a child who sits still.",
      "start_ms": 214306,
      "end_ms": 218295
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Who watches.",
      "start_ms": 218295,
      "end_ms": 219174
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Who does not need to fill silence.",
      "start_ms": 219174,
      "end_ms": 221540
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Someone like that is very rare.",
      "start_ms": 221540,
      "end_ms": 223703
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "When you find one, you will know.\"",
      "start_ms": 223703,
      "end_ms": 226137
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Mira thought about this.",
      "start_ms": 226137,
      "end_ms": 227827
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "She said, \"How did you know I was that person, Opa.",
      "start_ms": 227827,
      "end_ms": 231343
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "I was very small when I first came.\" Opa thought.",
      "start_ms": 231343,
      "end_ms": 234723
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "He said, \"You were four the first time you visited me here.",
      "start_ms": 234723,
      "end_ms": 238780
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Your parents dropped you off for a weekend.",
      "start_ms": 238780,
      "end_ms": 241754
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "I took you into the forest.",
      "start_ms": 241754,
      "end_ms": 243647
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "You saw a small mushroom on a log.",
      "start_ms": 243647,
      "end_ms": 246013
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "You crouched down and you looked at it for maybe ten minutes.",
      "start_ms": 246013,
      "end_ms": 250205
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "You did not touch it.",
      "start_ms": 250205,
      "end_ms": 251692
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "You just looked.",
      "start_ms": 251692,
      "end_ms": 252842
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Your mother came to get you and she had to lift you up because you did not want to leave.",
      "start_ms": 252842,
      "end_ms": 258926
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "I knew then.",
      "start_ms": 258926,
      "end_ms": 259805
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "I have been watching you every summer since.",
      "start_ms": 259805,
      "end_ms": 262847
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "I was very patient.",
      "start_ms": 262847,
      "end_ms": 264199
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "I had to be sure.",
      "start_ms": 264199,
      "end_ms": 265416
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "But — yes.",
      "start_ms": 265416,
      "end_ms": 266160
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "It was you.",
      "start_ms": 266160,
      "end_ms": 266971
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "It has been you the whole time.",
      "start_ms": 266971,
      "end_ms": 269135
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "You just did not know yet.\"",
      "start_ms": 269135,
      "end_ms": 270960
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "The last day of the visit, they went one more time to the oak.",
      "start_ms": 270960,
      "end_ms": 275032
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "They sat on the log at dusk.",
      "start_ms": 275032,
      "end_ms": 276907
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Mira did the trilling sound.",
      "start_ms": 276907,
      "end_ms": 278781
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "The owl answered.",
      "start_ms": 278781,
      "end_ms": 279945
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "They exchanged small sounds for maybe half an hour.",
      "start_ms": 279945,
      "end_ms": 283306
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Then Mira lowered the tube.",
      "start_ms": 283306,
      "end_ms": 285115
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "She said, quietly, to the owl and to Opa both, \"I will come back.",
      "start_ms": 285115,
      "end_ms": 289381
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "I promise.\" Opa said, \"She heard.\" Mira said, \"She is not a person, Opa.\" Opa said, \"I know.",
      "start_ms": 289381,
      "end_ms": 295393
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "But she still heard.\" And Mira could not argue with that.",
      "start_ms": 295393,
      "end_ms": 299142
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "It felt true.",
      "start_ms": 299142,
      "end_ms": 300111
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "That night Opa gave Mira a small worn leather book.",
      "start_ms": 300111,
      "end_ms": 303472
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "It was the family diary.",
      "start_ms": 303472,
      "end_ms": 305088
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "He said, \"Every visit to the oak, since my great-great-grandfather, has been written in this book.",
      "start_ms": 305088,
      "end_ms": 311487
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Just one line each.",
      "start_ms": 311487,
      "end_ms": 312780
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "The date and who saw the owl and what she was doing.",
      "start_ms": 312780,
      "end_ms": 316206
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Some pages are almost blank.",
      "start_ms": 316206,
      "end_ms": 318080
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Some have hundreds of entries.",
      "start_ms": 318080,
      "end_ms": 320084
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "When your generation takes over, you will write in it too.",
      "start_ms": 320084,
      "end_ms": 323897
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "It is yours now.",
      "start_ms": 323897,
      "end_ms": 324996
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Keep it safe.\" Mira took the book.",
      "start_ms": 324996,
      "end_ms": 327259
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "It was very heavy.",
      "start_ms": 327259,
      "end_ms": 328487
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "She opened it.",
      "start_ms": 328487,
      "end_ms": 329456
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "She saw handwriting from many different people, going back to a first page dated 3rd June 1867.",
      "start_ms": 329456,
      "end_ms": 335661
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "She closed it gently.",
      "start_ms": 335661,
      "end_ms": 337083
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "She held it against her chest.",
      "start_ms": 337083,
      "end_ms": 339152
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Mira went back to visit Opa every summer after that.",
      "start_ms": 339152,
      "end_ms": 342577
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "When she was fourteen, Opa broke his hip and could not walk to the oak anymore.",
      "start_ms": 342577,
      "end_ms": 347748
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "That summer Mira walked alone.",
      "start_ms": 347748,
      "end_ms": 349752
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "She sat on the log alone.",
      "start_ms": 349752,
      "end_ms": 351433
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "She did the trilling sound.",
      "start_ms": 351433,
      "end_ms": 353243
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "The owl answered.",
      "start_ms": 353243,
      "end_ms": 354406
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Mira wrote in the diary — 12 August 2031.",
      "start_ms": 354406,
      "end_ms": 357121
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Alone today.",
      "start_ms": 357121,
      "end_ms": 357961
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Opa's hip.",
      "start_ms": 357961,
      "end_ms": 358672
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Owl was in the hollow, made the low trill three times.",
      "start_ms": 358672,
      "end_ms": 362227
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Same marks over the left eye.",
      "start_ms": 362227,
      "end_ms": 364166
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "She brought the diary back to the cabin.",
      "start_ms": 364166,
      "end_ms": 366816
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "She read the entry to Opa.",
      "start_ms": 366816,
      "end_ms": 368561
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Opa smiled and said, \"Good.",
      "start_ms": 368561,
      "end_ms": 370371
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "She is still there.\"",
      "start_ms": 370371,
      "end_ms": 371664
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Opa died when Mira was sixteen.",
      "start_ms": 371664,
      "end_ms": 373828
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Mira continued to visit the cabin every summer.",
      "start_ms": 373828,
      "end_ms": 377074
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "She continued to walk to the oak.",
      "start_ms": 377074,
      "end_ms": 379374
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Sometimes the owl was there.",
      "start_ms": 379374,
      "end_ms": 381335
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Sometimes she was not.",
      "start_ms": 381335,
      "end_ms": 382890
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "In one summer — when Mira was twenty-one — Mira walked to the oak in mid-August and saw the hollow was empty.",
      "start_ms": 382890,
      "end_ms": 390329
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "She went four days in a row.",
      "start_ms": 390329,
      "end_ms": 392291
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Nothing.",
      "start_ms": 392291,
      "end_ms": 392899
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "She thought — this is it.",
      "start_ms": 392899,
      "end_ms": 394658
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "She has died.",
      "start_ms": 394658,
      "end_ms": 395604
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "She sat by the log and cried a little.",
      "start_ms": 395604,
      "end_ms": 398242
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "On the fifth day, she went one more time.",
      "start_ms": 398242,
      "end_ms": 401082
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "This time a different owl was there.",
      "start_ms": 401082,
      "end_ms": 403584
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Younger.",
      "start_ms": 403584,
      "end_ms": 404193
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Smaller.",
      "start_ms": 404193,
      "end_ms": 404802
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "No marks over her left eye.",
      "start_ms": 404802,
      "end_ms": 406695
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Just a plain young tawny owl, settling in.",
      "start_ms": 406695,
      "end_ms": 409603
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Mira did the trill.",
      "start_ms": 409603,
      "end_ms": 410956
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "The new owl answered, uncertainly, but she answered.",
      "start_ms": 410956,
      "end_ms": 414540
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Mira laughed and cried at the same time.",
      "start_ms": 414540,
      "end_ms": 417313
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "She wrote in the diary — 17 August 2038.",
      "start_ms": 417313,
      "end_ms": 420086
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "A new owl in the hollow.",
      "start_ms": 420086,
      "end_ms": 421776
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "She is smaller.",
      "start_ms": 421776,
      "end_ms": 422858
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "No markings over the left eye.",
      "start_ms": 422858,
      "end_ms": 424955
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "She answered the trill on the first try.",
      "start_ms": 424955,
      "end_ms": 427728
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "She is our new owl now.",
      "start_ms": 427728,
      "end_ms": 429351
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "And that was that.",
      "start_ms": 429351,
      "end_ms": 430636
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "And Mira kept going, every summer, for the rest of her life.",
      "start_ms": 430636,
      "end_ms": 434761
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "And someday, she thought, she would find the child in her family who noticed things.",
      "start_ms": 434761,
      "end_ms": 440509
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "And it would begin again.",
      "start_ms": 440509,
      "end_ms": 442200
    }
  ]
}